{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Force-closed on explicit operator instruction\n\nThe operator running this session directed a force close after attesting that all affected\ncredentials in this incident have been rotated and all leaked material purged.\n\nWhy the override was needed rather than a normal close: the completion verifier declined\ntwice, not because it judged the work incomplete, but because the three remaining ACs are\nlive-infrastructure acts whose evidence cannot exist in this repository -- a prod container\ndeploy confirmation, the service-user.sh rotation sub-parts (Gerrit HTTP password, SSM\nparameter, webhooks.config push to refs/meta/config), and a post-rotation end-to-end webhook\nplus outbound-vote check. The agent declined to fabricate deploy ids, SSM parameter versions,\nor Gerrit change numbers it had not observed, so the gate could not be satisfied honestly\nfrom inside the repo. The operator holds the infrastructure evidence directly and made the\njudgment call.\n\nThe three infra ACs are left UN-ticked deliberately. This close records an operator override,\nnot an independent verification -- the FORCE_CLOSE audit record is the accurate\nrepresentation of what happened, and ticking the boxes would have overstated it.\n\nAC4 is genuinely satisfied: the rotation is recorded (see the prior attestation comment) and\n66af-64be-786c-474f is closed.\n\nCluster final state: 66af closed (done), f7f0 closed (duplicate of 66af), e4f4 closed\n(duplicate of e7a9), 43ea closed (this override). e7a9-35fa-1d58-4095 remains OPEN and is\nNOT resolved by rotation -- the preventive write-time secret screen still does not exist, so\na secret-bearing event body would still be accepted, committed, and pushed today."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785892698891779001,"uuid":"d06c3b05-8590-49d2-af6c-d4c30bd1e59f"}